flowchart TB
  accTitle: Switching from another Autodarts integration
  accDescr: The original HACSAutodarts uses the autodarts domain; replace it in HACS and keep its entry, which is migrated. Quevinsta's and belese's integrations use the autodarts domain too; delete their entries, remove them in HACS, check that custom_components/autodarts is gone and restart. Autodarts Local, Autodarts Connect Online, Darts Hub and MQTT bridges have a domain of their own and can stay for now. Then install this integration, add the board, move the automations to its events and blueprints, and remove what nothing uses any more.
  OLD["Your Autodarts<br/>integration today"] --> DOMAIN{"Which domain<br/>does it use?"}
  DOMAIN -- "autodarts:<br/>the original<br/>HACSAutodarts" --> KEEP["Replace it in HACS<br/>and keep its entry,<br/>which is migrated"]
  DOMAIN -- "autodarts:<br/>Quevinsta, belese" --> REMOVE["Delete its entries,<br/>remove it in HACS,<br/>check that<br/>custom_components/autodarts<br/>is gone, restart"]
  DOMAIN -- "one of its own:<br/>Autodarts Local,<br/>Connect Online,<br/>Darts Hub, MQTT" --> BESIDE["It can stay<br/>for now"]
  REMOVE --> ADD["Install this integration<br/>and add the board"]
  BESIDE --> ADD
  ADD --> MOVE["Move the automations<br/>to its events<br/>and blueprints"]
  MOVE --> DONE["Remove what nothing<br/>uses any more"]
  classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
  classDef warn fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
  class KEEP,DONE done
  class REMOVE warn
